						200490202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优律"
				},
				{
					"id": 200490202,
					"content": "唉，要是宁禄在这的话，直接买他喜欢的就好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200490203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优律"
				},
				{
					"id": 200490203,
					"content": "抱歉，优律小姐，日落果已经卖光了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200490204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "昆恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 200490204,
					"content": "是这样吗？哎呀，那就只能买苹果了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200490205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优律"
				},
				{
					"id": 200490205,
					"content": "呃，优律小姐，这些苹果很不新鲜了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200490206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "昆恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 200490206,
					"content": "咦？是这样吗，但是我也没别的能选了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200490207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优律"
				},
				{
					"id": 200490207,
					"content": "我们来帮忙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200490208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 200490208,
					"content": "咦？你们…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200490209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "昆恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 200490209,
					"content": "就交给我们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200490210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200490210,
					"content": "放心吧，我们会去找新鲜的<color=#00E1FFFF>日落果</color>回来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200490211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 200490211,
					"content": "是，是这样吗？那就拜托了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200490212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "昆恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 200490212,
					"content": "那太好了，宁禄也更喜欢吃日落果一些，那我在这先等着吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "优律"
				}
